<title>USA: Somanetics extends warrant redemption date.</title>
<headline>Somanetics extends warrant redemption date.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somanetics Corp said Friday it extended the redemption date for Class B warrants to November 14 from September 26.</p>
<p>Somanetics said it took the action to allow holders more time to exercise their warrants. The last day for warrant holders to redeem their warrants for common stock is November 13, with an additional five-day broker protect period, the company said.</p>
<p>Class B warrants are traded under the symbol.</p>
</text>
